  "narrative": {
    "intro": "W S Darley and obligated $1.5B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. W S Darley and won 2,552 awards this period with an average award size of $603K, and obligations are up 3.6% year over year. W S Darley and received the bulk of its FY2026 to date obligations from the Department of Defense, which obligated $1.5B. W S Darley and has trended upward since FY21, with obligations listed as $431M in FY21, $624M in FY22, $965M in FY23, $1.2B in FY24, $1.5B in FY25, and $1.5B in FY26. W S Darley and sells across multiple NAICS markets, led by Service Establishment Equipment and Supplies Merchant Wholesalers at $901M and All Other Miscellaneous Manufacturing at $592M. W S Darley and also has smaller recorded markets including Photographic and Photocopying Equipment Manufacturing at $14.1M and Aircraft Manufacturing at $1.1M. This profile highlights a heavy concentration in a few markets and a dominant buyer relationship with one agency.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How concentrated are W S Darley and federal sales?",
        "body": "W S Darley and federal sales are highly concentrated. The Department of Defense obligated $1.5B, which represents the largest single agency buyer for FY2026 to date. W S Darley and has smaller obligations with the General Services Administration at $6.3M and the Department of Justice at $4.6M. W S Darley and listings include several agencies with negligible or zero obligations."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What are W S Darley and's main product markets?",
        "body": "W S Darley and main product markets are led by Service Establishment Equipment and Supplies Merchant Wholesalers at $901M and All Other Miscellaneous Manufacturing at $592M. W S Darley and also records obligations in Photographic and Photocopying Equipment Manufacturing at $14.1M and Surgical Appliance and Supplies Manufacturing at $11.3M. W S Darley and participates in a range of smaller manufacturing categories including Aircraft Manufacturing at $1.1M."
      }
    ]
  },
